This is a simple dialog to add a listing to the app store.

This dialog will provide you with additional details about a product you want to submit.
The user will be presented with an area where they can compose a description of their listing
followed by a area for rating and review of the listing.

When complete the information will be submitted and sent to iTunes Connect.

